# Board of Elections

A bipartisan, independent body established by the State of Missouri to protect the integrity of the voting process by accurately, securely, and efficiently conducting all elections in St. Louis County. Approximately 724,000 registered voters live in 974 precincts and vote in 200+ polling places within the county.

![Image 14: Page Icon](https://stlouiscountymo.gov/sites/default/cache/file/228791E9-44E9-453D-B8F970A48959C080_small.png)
